# MC Exchange rates file (.mcx)
# Only you edit this file. The app just reads it.
#
# Item types (default is raw, so only list non-stackables if you like):
#   @raw  = stackable raw material -> 1 ci = 64 items
#   @non  = non-stackable item     -> 1 ci = 8 items
# 1 cs = 64 ci
#
# Rates: "<amount> [cs|ci|items] <item> = <amount> [cs|ci|items] <item>"
# No unit means single items.

@raw Spruce wood, Diamond, Iron Ingot, Cobblestone, Kelp, Dried Kelp, Kelp block
@non Diamond Sword

2 ci Spruce wood = 1 Diamond
1 cs Cobblestone = 3 ci Iron Ingot
1 Diamond Sword = 2 Diamond
4 ci Kelp block = 1 Diamond
1 Diamond = 4 ci Kelp block
36 ci Kelp = 1 Diamond
24 ci Dried Kelp = 1 Diamond
1 Diamond = 24 ci Dried Kelp